<title>USA: Genzyme sees no reason for shr price drop.</title>
<headline>Genzyme sees no reason for shr price drop.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genzyme Corp's General division said it was not aware of any reason for the decline in its stock price on Monday.</p>
<p>Genzyme shares were trading down 1-1/8 at 21 at 13:34 EDT.</p>
<p>The biotechnology company said there had been no material changes in its business or forecasts since third quarter results were released on October 24.</p>
<p>Its general division develops and markets pharmaceuticals, genetic diagnostic services, and therapeutic, diagnostic, and surgical products.</p>
